  "details": "Like in the title, I cannot see my avatar at all in worlds within the mirrors. Other players can see me, I can see their reflections, but not mine. It's in every world I join. Ive been online for 3 hours with no fix. Ive restarted and factor reset my headset, un-installed vrchat, closed and opened the app, cleared cache, changed avatar height, reset my avatar, changed avatar, changed boundary, even changed my IK setting, and played on PC with the same issue. What is going on... ive tried practically everything. Ive seen others post online and find solutions, but those solutions unfortunately don't work for me. I am wondering what is going on and if someone has a different solution.",
